# Allowlist: the server image (root Dockerfile, also used by Fly.io and docker-compose) only needs
# the Cargo workspace plus the files it embeds with include_str!/include_bytes! (docs/ and the
# built JS SDK). Everything else (.claude/, .git/, target/, node_modules, other SDKs, site/) stays
# out of the build context. If a build fails with "file not found", add the path below.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!docs/
!sdks/js/dist/
!geoip/

# Never ship build output or local junk, even inside allowed directories.
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
